WEBVTT

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:13.600
Mikhail?

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:18.480
You've grown up, Yuliy.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.450
I knew I wasn't mistaken.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:26.240
So it is you, brother.

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:30.830
Why did you go
without saying anything then?

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.120
It was impossible.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.500
When we find a Jaeger, we must kill it.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:41.340
That's the rule in our Vampire world.

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:49.890
Mikhail, you're a Vampire after all.

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:53.680
Yeah. I'm not supposed to be here now.

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:56.600
You must have noticed my smell.

00:00:58.110 --> 00:01:01.860
Well, I'm not entirely trusted by them.

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:05.490
When I shot you,
I was ordered to kill you.

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:11.740
The last thing I wanted
was to kill my dear little brother,

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:13.660
so I avoided your vital spots.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Aren't I good?

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:18.710
Why?
I thought you didn't use guns, Mikhail.

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:23.920
Oh, I taught you how to hunt long ago.

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:28.720
That's right, I told you not to use it
because it would make your nose useless...

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:32.350
though that doesn't concern me anymore
since I've become a Vampire.

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.730
Yuliy, why did you become a Jaeger?

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:43.230
For vengeance, of course.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:48.280
I'll kill every single one of the bastards
who robbed us of our mother and tribe.

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:49.990
I see.

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:53.330
You're a Jaeger, and I'm a Vampire...

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:57.660
At this rate,
we'll have to kill each other eventually.

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:00.880
I thought you were already dead.

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:05.380
But I was finally able to
meet the only living family I have...

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:08.550
and you say we have to kill each other.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.840
I don't know how to answer that.

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:15.060
Then I'll say this as your big brother...

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:18.730
Yuliy, stop this vengeance now.

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:14.890
Iba, entering.

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:18.600
Major general.

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:25.060
-Please stay here until the next station.
-Yes.

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:28.480
When we get there,
we'll have you contact your parents.

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:30.480
Yes. I'm sorry.

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:33.320
Miss?

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:36.280
Why are you on this train?

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:38.450
No-- No.

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:40.580
Well... these.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:42.750
Would you like to have these together?

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:46.500
Stop this vengeance?

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:49.090
What do you mean, Mikhail?

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:51.590
I can tell by looking in your eyes...

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:54.800
The role of avenger
is far too much for you.

00:04:55.800 --> 00:05:01.220
An avenger's eyes are full of anger,
hate, sadness, and despair.

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:04.520
Your eyes are just those
of a spoiled brat.

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:05.770
That's not true.

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:09.360
I have lived only to kill Vampires.

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:11.530
Then why don't you kill me?

00:05:12.780 --> 00:05:15.650
After killing every single Vampire
besides me,

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.860
are you going to kill me last?

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:19.240
That's...

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:23.580
Now, hurry up and kill me.

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:25.870
Without a minute or a second to lose,

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:28.710
you want to kill as many Vampires
as you can, right?

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:31.130
Then now is your best chance.

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:32.880
I won't resist.

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:34.460
What's the matter?

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:38.590
It's all right now, Yuliy.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:41.180
You can't become completely cruel.

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:42.850
Forget about it already.

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:44.770
About me, Dogville...

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:46.600
and Mother.

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:49.190
And about the Ark.

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:50.900
The Ark?

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:55.570
But if you again appear before me
as a Jaeger,

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:58.490
you will no longer be my brother...

00:05:59.320 --> 00:06:00.410
You will be my enemy.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:06.660
What an awful scar.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:13.460
Iba, I'd be satisfied if it were you
who tells me that I am finished.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.840
Please don't say such odd things.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:17.760
What happened exactly?

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:21.640
I received a report there was an accident
at the drill in Fuji--

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:22.850
It was no accident.

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:24.560
It was...

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:27.350
It was a one-sided massacre.

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:28.560
Massacre?

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:32.110
I let a great many men die.

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:36.360
I assume they were going to
experiment on us from the beginning.

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:37.780
They?

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:40.320
Meaning the Alma Trading Company?

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.120
We walked right into their trap.

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:46.490
We shouldn't have gotten involved
with such a monster,

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:50.250
one made in such an abominable way.

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:52.790
Sir, what is it exactly?

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:55.630
It must not be brought into
the Imperial Capital.

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:57.550
Something must be done.

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:00.720
<i>It can't be...</i>

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:05.810
<i>It's being transported on this train?</i>

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:16.860
Master, our prey is in sight.
It's heading towards us.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:20.530
Let's go. It's time to hunt!

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:25.200
You're quite an active young lady,
chasing after a sweetheart.

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:26.910
Not a sweetheart!

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:30.040
That's-- That's not it.

00:07:31.670 --> 00:07:34.500
I was just worried about Yuliy.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.090
Yeah, hence he is your sweetheart.

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:39.210
That's not--

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:42.050
Yuliy doesn't know the difference
between love and pain.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:44.890
I think it'll be difficult
to make him yours.

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:47.100
No, it's not like that.

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:50.730
Besides, you and Yuliy live in
entirely different worlds.

00:07:50.890 --> 00:07:51.730
That's it!

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:55.400
That's also what worries me.

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:57.820
Is Yuliy...?

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:02.280
Are all of you working on
something dangerous?

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:03.660
Miss...

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:09.950
Well, why don't you bring that lunch
and ask Yuliy yourself?

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.210
Please don't change the subject--

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:26.720
What happened?

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:29.600
That is...

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:34.850
I am The Hyakko Party leader,
Naotora Momose.

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:39.570
For the greater cause,
we will take possession of this train!

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:44.610
The Hya-- Hyakko Party!

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:46.820
-Why did we stop?
-Call the conductor.

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:50.790
-It can't be.
-It's all right.

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:52.870
-Excuse me, sir!
-What is it?

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:55.790
Pirates claiming to be The Hyakko Party
have raided us.

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.210
Hyakko Party? Why them?

00:08:57.290 --> 00:09:00.670
Currently, the on-board soldiers
are engaging the enemy to contain them.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:02.880
Protection of civilians is top priority.

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:06.050
-Don't let them near the passenger cars.
-Yes, sir.

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:09.220
Major Iba, I'm sorry
but can you join the guards

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:12.060
-and assist the tactical command?
-Yes, sir.

00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:14.560
I will assist the tactical command, sir.

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:19.560
-Hurry!
-Please don't push!

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:21.070
-Let's go!
-Get out of the way!

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:23.280
Dorothea, what is this?

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:27.490
Leave the rest to us
and flee with the others!

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:36.580
What's the matter?
A half-wit shot like that won't hit me.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:39.880
You need to aim better!

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:45.130
Let's begin.

00:09:49.510 --> 00:09:53.680
The Hyakko Party stated social reform
as their grand slogan...

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:56.600
but they were just a gang of thieves
after all.

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:01.230
Even if you are Mr. Yevgraf's favorite,

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:03.610
don't just move around as you please.

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:05.110
This mess...

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:08.240
It's your fault
for only cutting off financial aid,

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:09.700
and doing nothing more.

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:12.030
The Jaegers are here too.

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.950
Inferior and foolish humans.

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:18.330
Just like hyenas.

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:21.250
No. Wasn't there a wolf too?

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:25.000
Let's leave this up to Klarwein.

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:31.640
Mikhail, why don't you use those claws
and fangs once in a while too?

00:10:33.350 --> 00:10:35.310
Damn! They'll take over the freight car!

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:39.270
-Don't let them into the passenger car!
-Go! That's where we need firepower!

00:10:39.350 --> 00:10:42.190
Don't spread out.
Stay together and move along the train!

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:45.610
Search for Kershner.

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:49.070
He must be on board this train,
with the treasure.

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:54.870
Master!

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:56.370
What is it?

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:02.380
What is this bizarre armor and helmet?

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:06.300
This can't be the new weapon
they were talking about.

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:11.470
-It moved.
-Is it alive?

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:12.510
Is it mechanical?

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:39.830
This is truly interesting!

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:44.040
For such monsters,
they've created quite a tasteful thing!

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:48.760
All right,
start the train and search for Kershner!

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:50.420
Find him and tie him up.

00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:54.050
-Make him bow down before me!
<i>-Sir!</i>

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:09.440
All right. Let's scram!

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:17.530
-What's going on?
-What's happening?

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:18.450
Yuliy...

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:24.830
Miss, hurry and get off the train.

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:26.000
Hurry!

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:28.380
I'm sorry!

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:31.420
Major, sir!

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:33.680
-We're headed in the wrong direction!
-What?

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:36.680
Are they trying to steal the entire train?

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:44.350
Slaves!

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:47.400
-Ume, hurry!
-Ume!

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:55.570
Are you okay?

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:58.280
-Thank you, big brother.
-Ume!

00:12:58.570 --> 00:12:59.780
Mom!

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:02.000
Brother.

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:04.250
<i>Yuliy.</i>

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:08.040
<i>But if you again appear before me</i>
<i>as a Jaeger...</i>

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:12.260
<i>you will no longer my brother.</i>

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:15.470
<i>Even then, I...</i>

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:25.850
Fire, fire!
Don't let them advance any further!

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:29.610
Don't back down!
Show them our Samurai pride!

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:47.920
-Hey! What is that?
-Something serious is happening.

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:51.750
Fallon, follow that train.

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:53.710
Hurry.

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:55.550
Roger!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:18.070
-This is great!
-Master.

00:14:18.320 --> 00:14:21.410
It defended us from them.
The thing is adorable.

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.240
What's wrong, comrades? Now, stand up!

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:26.580
With this, restoring our rights

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:29.750
-as former Samurai can be easily achieved.
-I guess it's showtime.

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:31.540
Now, monster!

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:34.960
As my servant,
wreak havoc as much as you desire!

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:37.670
The Showa Restoration
is right in front of us!

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:04.870
Master has been killed!

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:06.700
Master?

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.370
Hey, what do we do?

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:10.420
What do you mean, what do we do?

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:26.760
-Hey, no one's there.
-What?

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:29.520
Will the train stop if we leave it be?

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:41.320
Damn. The tires are screwed.

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:43.530
What on earth is going on?

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:45.700
Dorothea?

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:48.080
You must be mistaken.

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:50.330
Trust me, I know my crew!

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:51.830
This is not good.

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:54.460
There's a dead end up ahead.

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:57.090
And a downward hill continues towards it.

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:59.710
-That's...
-Fallon, I'll take the wheel.

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:02.680
Join Dorothea's group and stop the train!

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:23.320
Dorothea!

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:27.240
What the hell kept you?

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:30.080
You're so mean.

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:33.500
-I'll cut off the rear passenger cars.
-You got it.

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:53.680
Nice job. Enormous strength!

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.280
Yuliy?

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:07.780
Yuliy.

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:11.160
Stop the train.
There's a dead end up ahead!

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:14.710
What a reckless thing you're all doing!

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:16.120
You're the reckless one.

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:18.880
Meeting you here
must be some kind of fate.

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:20.500
Please let me help too.

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:29.100
<i>Brother.</i>

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:32.970
<i>I thought I'd never see you again.</i>

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:36.560
<i>Even then...</i>

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:38.730
<i>Even then, I always...</i>

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:40.650
<i>I wanted to see you, Mikhail!</i>

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:54.160
It's not a Vampire?

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:58.170
But it smells just like them.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:01.790
I have things to do up ahead.

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:04.260
If you won't get out of my way...

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:12.560
-Major, sir.
-Retreat for now.

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:14.680
Join the soldiers in the back.

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:28.400
You're that intruder from the other day.

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:30.660
You...

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:32.450
What? Do you know each other?

00:18:32.530 --> 00:18:35.830
He's a newspaper man
who's snooping around about us.

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:38.960
Hey, now.
Why is a newspaper man carrying a gun?

00:18:39.370 --> 00:18:40.540
It's for protection.

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:44.250
-Necessary when chasing a dangerous story.
-Major!

00:18:45.050 --> 00:18:46.090
Watch out!

00:18:58.770 --> 00:18:59.640
Miss.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:03.690
I've killed someone...

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:07.650
It's all right. It's not human.

00:19:08.320 --> 00:19:09.150
What?

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:12.780
See?

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:15.580
According to the 7-year-old
daughter's testimony,

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:18.330
the Professor turned into
glowing ash and disappeared.

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:20.000
It can't be...

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:23.580
If you're a reporter,
won't this be a better story?

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.170
What on earth is this?

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:26.880
Never seen one?

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:28.590
It's a Vampire.

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:33.010
Vampire?

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:41.980
How lucky I am to be able to gather
combat data against a Jaeger here!

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:52.030
What?

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:57.540
Oh, no. No! It won't stop!

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:11.340
After all that I said, you still came?

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:16.100
Really, you always have chased after me.

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:18.180
Mikhail?

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:25.020
So you can't be stopped anymore...

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:45.170
I'll put you out of your misery right now.

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:19.580
Yuliy.

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:25.870
If-- If I become like him too...

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:29.920
I want you to kill me.

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:34.010
What do you mean, kill you?

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:38.010
If you have the Ark...

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:42.060
If you have the Ark of Sirius,
you can do it.

00:21:43.270 --> 00:21:45.730
You can spare a life or take it.

00:21:47.190 --> 00:21:48.230
That means...

00:21:55.530 --> 00:21:56.360
Brother.

00:22:06.960 --> 00:22:08.620
Ten years...

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:12.130
That's quite a detour.

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:15.210
But compared to the next 1000 years...

00:22:16.130 --> 00:22:16.970
or better yet...

00:22:17.680 --> 00:22:21.970
eternity, it was only a moment.

00:22:23.720 --> 00:22:24.970
EPISODE 5
THE FRANKENSTEIN

00:24:02.740 --> 00:24:04.280
<i>A way to live without vengeance.</i>

00:24:04.370 --> 00:24:05.990
<i>Damn. For the army to meddle...</i>

00:24:06.080 --> 00:24:07.990
<i>-In time of need, I'll be bait.</i>
<i>-What?</i>

00:24:08.080 --> 00:24:10.660
<i>-Yuliy wants to quit as a Jaeger?</i>
<i>-I'm your opponent!</i>

00:24:10.750 --> 00:24:12.040
EPISODE 6
MOCKINGBIRD'S SONG

00:24:21.670 --> 00:24:25.050
Subtitle translation by Haruna Saito
